            <ArticleTitle>Advanced concepts in interventional spine care.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S8-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review of interventional treatment of the spine emphasizes the need for aggressive pain control as a means of preventing persistent pain. The use and application of lumbar epidural injections, facet blocks/denervation, lysis of epidural adhesions, thermal annuloplasty, radiofrequency neurotomy, and nucleoplasty are the treatment options described. These descriptions are not all-inclusive of advanced treatment options for patients with spine pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
